hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1237","Hazrat Jabir raziyallahu anhu se rivayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya apne bachon ko apne paas rok lo yahan tak ke shaam ka ibtedai hissa guzar jaye kyunke yeh woh waqt hai jis mein shayateen phail jaate hain."
"1238","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Hisham bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Mamar ne humein khabar di Saeed bin Abdur Rahman se Saib se Umar se unhon ne kaha aksar Quraish ke kuch aadmi Hazrat Ibn Masood ke darwaze par baithe rehte the phir jab saya dhal jata to woh kehte uth jao jo baqi reh gaya woh shaitan ke liye hai phir woh kisi shakhs ke paas se na guzarte magar use khada kar dete unhon ne kaha phir jab woh isi haal mein the ke kaha gaya yeh Banu Has-has ka maula hai jo sher kehta hai to unhon ne use bulaya aur kaha tum ne kya kaha tha to us ne kaha Sulayma ko alvida kaho agar tum Allah ki raah mein jihad ke liye tayyar ho jao safed baal aur Islam aadmi ko rokne ke liye kafi hain to unhon ne kaha bas karo tum ne sach kaha tum ne sach kaha."
"1239","Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Mamar ne humein khabar di Saeed bin Abdur Rahman al Jahshi se Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm se Saib bin Yazid se unhon ne kaha Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu dopahar ke waqt ya us ke qareeb hamare paas se guzarte the to kehte utho aur qailula karo phir jo baqi reh gaya woh shaitan ke liye hai."
"1240","Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya Humaid se Hazrat Anas se unhon ne kaha woh Juma ki namaz parhte the phir qailula karte the."
"1241","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Sulaiman bin al Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya Sabit se Hazrat Anas ne kaha jab sharab haram hui to Ahle Madina ke liye khajoor aur busr se zyada pasandeeda koi sharab na thi main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba ko sharab pila raha tha jabke woh Hazrat Abu Talha ke paas the ek shakhs guzra to us ne kaha beshak sharab haram kar di gayi hai to unhon ne na kaha kab hui ya yeh ke hum intezar karke dekhte hain unhon ne kaha ae Anas use baha do phir unhon ne Hazrat Umm Sulaim ke paas qailula kiya yahan tak ke thandak ho gayi aur unhon ne ghusl kiya phir Hazrat Umm Sulaim ne unhein khushbu lagayi phir woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas gaye to khabar waisi hi thi jaisi us shakhs ne kahi thi Hazrat Anas ne kaha phir unhon ne us ke baad use kabhi na chakha."
"1242","Muhammad bin Muqatil ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdullah ne humein khabar di unhon ne kaha Misar ne hum se bayan kiya Sabit bin Ubaid se Ibn Abi Laila se Hazrat Khawwat bin Jubair se unhon ne kaha din ke shuru hisse ki neend na samjhi hai aur darmiyani hisse ki neend adat hai aur aakhri hisse ki neend bewaqufi hai."
